  "content_en": "Si Mian hid at the door and couldn't hear clearly what was said, but seeing that no one noticed her, she had no interest in joining in and planned to sneak away later. Su Jianhao kept trying to connect the two, but he felt that Gu Mo was a little indifferent and secretly worried. At this time, a woman in professional attire walked towards the lounge. Si Mian quickly stepped aside. The woman knocked on the door, then went in, walked up to the man and said a few words. Gu Mo raised his eyes and said to Su Jianhao, \"Uncle Su, please excuse me, I have something urgent to deal with.\" \"President Gu, you are busy, don't worry about us.\" Su Jianhao immediately stood up to see him off. Seeing that the people inside were about to come out, Si Mian slipped away. ..... In the office, Gu Mo was talking to someone. Suddenly, he frowned and looked out through the glass. A petite girl was sneaking around not far away. At first glance, it seemed that he was not a staff member, and his behavior was very suspicious. Gu Mo had an unhappy look on his face, \"Is this a vegetable market? Anyone can come in?\" The assistant immediately called the special police officers and prepared to intercept. Gu Mo thought that she would be arrested by the SWAT officers after a while, but when they were about to approach, the assistant waved the SWAT officers to stop. Then she ran over with a smile on her face and said a few words to her. Then she nodded and walked in the other direction. But when the girl raised her head slightly, the profile of her face felt so familiar to him. Gu Mo narrowed his eyes, why was she here? She couldn't be a staff member here, otherwise she wouldn't have known who Gu Mo was that day. The assistant came back and quickly explained, \"That little girl came with the Su family and is the old man's guest.\" Did dad bring her? Gu Mo raised his eyebrows. He still knew his father's requirements for choosing a wife. Not only did he want everyone to be a lady, but he also wanted Xiaojiabiyu. This girl looked like a troublemaker, and his father would definitely not include her in the selection. Gu Mo lowered his eyes without leaving a trace, \"Send this document, I'm going to greet the guests first.\" Although he didn't want to go back and face the people of the Su family, after all, it was his father who brought it, so Gu Mo still had to give him this face. After handling the matter, he went back. Su Jianhao was naturally overjoyed. Gu Mo glanced around and saw no sneaky figure, \"Uncle Gu, I remember you brought two daughters here today. Why did you only see Miss Su Er?\" At this time, Su Jianhao and Liu Zilan realized that Si Mian was not here. , Su Jianhao glanced at Liu Zilan reproachfully, then paused and said, \"Mianmian went to the bathroom and will be back later.\" \"Since she's not here, I'll tell you first that I want to marry her.\" Gu Mo casually dropped the bombshell. Everyone looked at Gu Mo in disbelief and all had the same question in their hearts, was he joking? But Gu Mo had no intention of answering. Sitting there, even if he didn't speak, his aura was very strong. Liu Zilan's heartbeat accelerated and she hurried out to look for someone. After finally finding it, Liu Zilan looked left and right at Si Mian. It wasn't that she looked down on her daughter, but it was because there was indeed a gap between Si Mian and Xin Xin. As a mother, she knew very well what kind of temper Mianmian was like. When she was wild, she was like a tomboy. However, after she married into the Su family, she obviously restrained herself a lot. She is really not qualified to be the CEO's wife. Si Mian was puzzled, \"Mom, what's wrong with you? Is it possible that you don't even recognize your daughter?\" \"Mianmian, I don't know if it's a blessing or a curse, but I'll tell you first so that you can be mentally prepared. The president wants to marry you.\" Liu Zilan touched her cheek. The mother felt half sad and half happy. \"Ah -\" Si Mian was stunned, what is this, the CEO wants to marry her? When did she become so famous that even the CEO admired her. Pushing open the door to the lounge, Si Mian mustered up the courage to shout, \"I won't get married.\"",
  "translated": true
}